<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 8.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 8.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 8.23 percent on Wednesday from 8.50 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded on the market in 11 reported transactions with a total value of 15.75 million dinars ($22 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
